    <string name="about_privacy_heading">Privacy</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_statement">Your library, downloads and listening history stay on this device. You do not need an account, and the app has no ads, analytics or crash reporting. When you update or listen to a show, its hosts receive the requests needed to deliver the content. Offline mode pauses all app network activity. Keep exported subscription files private if they contain private feed links.</string>
    <string name="about_license_heading">Application license</string>
    <string name="about_license_status">PlainPodDroid is free and open source, released under the MIT license.</string>
    <string name="about_dependencies_heading">Open-source components</string>
    <string name="about_dependencies">Playback is powered by AndroidX Media3, with OkHttp handling connections. Thanks to these projects and the other open-source libraries that make this app possible.</string>
